  "content": "<center>\n\t<img style=\"width: 1142px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/wordmarks/outlined/cracked/cf32_wordmark.png\">\n\t<h1>一种双倍分辨率的纹理包，延续了Vattic原始的Faithful 32x32包的经典纹理。</h1>\n</center>\n<p>\n\t作为对Faithful艺术风格变化的回应，Classic Faithful 32x旨在完全恢复和保留Vattic原始的“绘画”艺术。最重要的是，它还保持该包更新，重新制作新纹理以匹配经典风格。\n\t<br><br>\n\tClassic Faithful 32x全力以赴！这个包包含了Vattic自己的所有经典纹理。在适用的情况下，他时代之后的纹理也被修改成与他的艺术风格一致，通常使用复杂的逆向工程过程以确保包的准确性。安装此包来获得一次真正的怀旧之旅！\n  \n</p>\n<center>\n\t<a href=\"https://discord.gg/KSEhCVtg4J\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n\t\t<img style=\"width: 1142px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/discord_button.png\" alt=\"Discord服务器\">\n\t</a>\n  <br><br>\n\t<a href=\"https://faithfulpack.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n\t\t<img style=\"width: 1142px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/website_button.png\" alt=\"网站\">\n\t</a>\n</center>\n<hr>\n<center><h2>附加信息：</h2></center>\n<p>\n\t如果您有任何反馈、想报告错误或一般需要帮助，请加入上面的我们的<a href=\"https://discord.gg/sN9YRQbBv7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Discord</a>服务器，创建一个<a href=\"https://github.com/ClassicFaithful/32x-Programmer-Art/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub问题</a>，或在下方评论。对于任何商业或分发相关的问题，请参阅我们的<a href=\"http://faithfulpack.net/license\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">许可证</a>。\n\t<br><br>\n\t所有纹理和扩展项均由志愿者利用业余时间提供。任何人都可以通过上面链接的Discord服务器提交纹理，或者制作一个<a href=\"http://faithfulpack.net/addons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">扩展项</a>以在我们的网站上正式列出。在开始之前，请务必阅读我们的<a href=\"https://docs.faithfulpack.net/pages/textures/cf32-texturing-guidelines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">纹理指南</a>，它们详细说明了该包的艺术风格。\n\t<br><br>\n\t每个包都在我们的<a href=\"faithfulpack.net\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">网站</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/faithful_resource_pack/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CurseForge</a>、<a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/member/faithful_resource_pack/submissions/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Planet Minecraft</a>和<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Faithful-Resource-Pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Modrinth</a>上列出，一些包还额外列于<a href=\"https://mcpedl.com/user/faithful-resource-pack/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">MCPEDL</a>和<a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/members/Faithful_Resource_Pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Minecraft Forums</a>。<strong>从任何其他站点下载都是非官方、不受支持且可能危险的！</strong>记住要在互联网上保持安全。\n</p>\n<hr>\n<center><h2>我们的其他项目：</h2></center>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\">\n\t<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/faithful-32x\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n\t\t<img\n\t\t\tstyle=\"width: 1142px;\"\n\t\t\tsrc=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/f32_button.png\"\n\t\t\talt=\"Faithful 32x\"\n\t\t>\n\t</a>\n\t<br><br>\n\t<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/faithful-64x\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n\t\t<img\n\t\t\tstyle=\"width: 1142px;\"\n\t\t\tsrc=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/f64_button.png\"\n\t\t\talt=\"Faithful 64x\"\n\t\t>\n\t</a>\n    <br><br>\n\t<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/classic-faithful-32x-jappa\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n\t\t<img\n\t\t\tstyle=\"width: 1142px;\"\n\t\t\tsrc=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/cf32j_button.png\"\n\t\t\talt=\"Classic Faithful 32x Jappa\"\n\t\t>\n\t</a>\n\t<br><br>\n\t<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-64x\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n\t\t<img\n\t\t\tstyle=\"width: 1142px;\"\n\t\t\tsrc=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/cf64j_button.png\"\n\t\t\talt=\"Classic Faithful 64x Jappa\"\n\t\t>\n\t</a>\n</div>",
